{"content":[{"c":["COAL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Translation of several Hebrew or Greek words in the Bible referring primarily to charcoal (mineral coal is not found in Palestine). The glowing embers from a wood fire were used for heating (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.47.14","r":"Isa.47.14","rawR":"Isa.47.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.47.14","value":"Isa.47.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 47:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.18.18","r":"John.18.18","rawR":"John.18.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.18.18","value":"John.18.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 18:18"},"), cooking (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.44.19","r":"Isa.44.19","rawR":"Isa.44.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.44.19","value":"Isa.44.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 44:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.21.9","r":"John.21.9","rawR":"John.21.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.21.9","value":"John.21.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 21:9"},"), and by blacksmiths (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.54.16","r":"Isa.54.16","rawR":"Isa.54.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.54.16","value":"Isa.54.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 54:16"},"). Coals from the altar were used in religious ritual (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.16.12","r":"Lev.16.12","rawR":"Lev.16.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.16.12","value":"Lev.16.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 16:12"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.6.6-7","r":"Isa.6.6-7","rawR":"Isa.6.6-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.6.6-7","value":"Isa.6.6-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 6:6-7"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Figuratively, the term is used in descriptions of God’s infinite brightness and glory (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.22.9,13","r":"2Sam.22.9,13","rawR":"2Sam.22.9,13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.22.9,13","value":"2Sam.22.9,13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 22:9, 13"},"), of his revelation (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.18.8","r":"Ps.18.8","rawR":"Ps.18.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.18.8","value":"Ps.18.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 18:8"},"), of divine judgment (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.140.10","r":"Ps.140.10","rawR":"Ps.140.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.140.10","value":"Ps.140.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"140:10"},") and of creatures associated with God’s throne (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.1.13","r":"Ezek.1.13","rawR":"Ezek.1.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.1.13","value":"Ezek.1.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 1:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.10.2","r":"Ezek.10.2","rawR":"Ezek.10.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.10.2","value":"Ezek.10.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:2"},"). In other metaphorical passages, glowing coals stand for life (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.14.7","r":"2Sam.14.7","rawR":"2Sam.14.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.14.7","value":"2Sam.14.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 14:7"},", ",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), the breath of a huge beast (“leviathan,” ",{"href":"?bref=Job.41.21","r":"Job.41.21","rawR":"Job.41.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Job.41.21","value":"Job.41.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jb 41:21"},"), and the risk of being “burned” by sexual sin (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.6.28","r":"Pr.6.28","rawR":"Pr.6.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.6.28","value":"Pr.6.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 6:28"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Coal","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Is 47:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.47.14","rawQueryValue":"Isa.47.14","sourceRefExact":"Isa.47.14"},{"anchorText":"Jn 18:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.18.18","rawQueryValue":"John.18.18","sourceRefExact":"John.18.18"},{"anchorText":"Is 44:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.44.19","rawQueryValue":"Isa.44.19","sourceRefExact":"Isa.44.19"},{"anchorText":"Jn 21:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.21.9","rawQueryValue":"John.21.9","sourceRefExact":"John.21.9"},{"anchorText":"Is 54:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.54.16","rawQu